     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">print_time()</code> creates <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">out_str</code> as a local variable. <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">out_str</code> is only in scope in <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">print_time()</code> and cannot be accessed elsewhere."
